    * ``pygplates.PointOnSphere.north_pole``
    * ``pygplates.PointOnSphere.south_pole``

    A *PointOnSphere* can also be `pickled <https://docs.python.org/3/library/pickle.html>`_.

    .. versionchanged:: 0.42
       Added pickle support.
